        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Roger Yuan, Tom Gormican\n- Films: Once Upon a Time in Vietnam, Movie 43, The Unbearable Weight of Massive Talent, That Awkward Moment, Showtime, Failure to Launch, Marmaduke\n- Roles: actor, film director\n\nFacts:\n- Roger Yuan starred in Once Upon a Time in Vietnam.\n- Roger Yuan also appeared in Movie 43.\n- That Awkward Moment was the directorial debut of American film director Tom Gormican.\n- Tom Gormican's other credits include writing or working on Movie 43, The Unbearable Weight of Massive Talent, Showtime, Failure to Launch, and Marmaduke.",
