        "original_id": "654030b8-edad-5d8e-94dd-b8b19b974a8d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Dey, Alfred Gough, Miles Millar, Roger Yuan, Dustin Nguyen, Jackie Chan, Chow Yun-fat\n- Works: Shanghai Noon, Showtime, Failure to Launch, Marmaduke, Bulletproof Monk, Batman Begins, Skyfall, Once Upon a Time in Vietnam\n- Roles: director, screenwriter, producer, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Dey was born on April 14, 1965, and is an American film director, screenwriter, and producer.\n- Shanghai Noon marked the directorial debut of Tom Dey.\n- Alfred Gough and Miles Millar wrote Shanghai Noon.\n- Roger Yuan appeared in Shanghai Noon in 2000 opposite Jackie Chan.\n- Roger Yuan appeared in Bulletproof Monk in 2003 alongside Chow Yun-fat.\n- Roger Yuan appeared as the technician in Batman Begins in 2005.\n- Roger Yuan appeared as Severine's bodyguard in Skyfall in 2012.\n- Once Upon a Time in Vietnam is a 2013 Vietnamese action fantasy film directed by Dustin Nguyen and starring Dustin Nguyen along with Roger Yuan.\n- Tom Dey's credits include Shanghai Noon, Showtime, Failure to Launch, and Marmaduke.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
